# Optional build-time default for the backend URL.
#
# Copy to `.env` and set this if you would rather bake the address into the
# build than edit `dist/config.json` after uploading. `config.json` still wins
# at runtime when it is present and non-empty.
#
# Leave unset for the single-service deployment, where FastAPI serves the built
# frontend from its own origin and the API is simply at /api.

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
